{
  "GHSA-g7r4-m6w7-qqqr": {
    "notes": "The advisory is about esbuild's development server allowing arbitrary file reads on Windows. esbuild is a transitive devDependency here (via tsx and vitest) used only as a build/test transform — its development server is never run, and nothing ships to consumers. Remove this exception once tsx/vite pick up esbuild >=0.28.1."
  },
  "GHSA-g3hv-75wg-m249": {
    "notes": "The advisory is about a glob pattern that an attacker supplies to minimatch. minimatch is a transitive devDependency here, through @typescript-eslint/typescript-estree, which reads only the patterns in this repository's own ESLint and tsconfig files. Nothing ships to consumers. Remove this exception once typescript-estree accepts minimatch >=11.0.1."
  }
}
